results.description:
ALERT: Bandits are currently in Tsuna community in Gusau LGA of Zamfara State. They invaded the community and also blocked the community way to Fegin Mahe community were security operatives stationed. Security assistance is highly needed.

Please, retweet massively to pass the message to the authorities, may our effort save lives.

